<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saturday's spot rupee rates in kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				Buying rate	 Selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   41.18		 41.23</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	66.65		 66.75</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 24.35		 24.40</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.333		 0.335</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   10.98		 11.00</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    11.22		 11.24</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.08		  1.10</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 3.25 pct	    3.50 pct</p>
</text>
